5,0,1,talk,Servas,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. Let us approach this game with wisdom and kindness.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Hello. I hope we can find the truth together.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,"Hi everyone! I'm a bit nervous, but let's do our best to find the werewolf!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Victoria,,I will be observing closely. Let us see how everyone behaves.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,May,,This should be fun! I'll be watching all of you very carefully.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,Does anyone have any initial thoughts or strategies they wish to share?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,I prefer to listen for now.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,Maybe we can all just be honest? Though I know that's not how the game works!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"Honesty is a luxury in this game, Yumi.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,May,,"Exactly. A little mystery makes it more exciting, don't you think?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"True, but we must remain cohesive to protect the village.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Servas.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,I'll trust you guys!,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Victoria,,I am curious if anyone feels particularly confident in their role already.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,May,,"I'm always confident, Victoria. But I'll keep my secrets for now.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
