31,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must be cautious today. The first vote is always the hardest.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,Indeed. We have very little information to go on.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"I don't want to vote for anyone I like, but we have to!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I have information. May is the werewolf.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,May,,"What? Victoria, that's a bold lie! Why would you frame me so early?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Victoria, are you claiming to be the Seer?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,It is a very direct accusation.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"Wait, really? May, is that true?","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"Yes, I am the Seer. I divined May last night, and the result was clear.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,May,,She's trying to get me out immediately because I'm too charismatic! It's a classic play.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Servas,,"If Victoria is the Seer, the choice is simple. But we must consider if she is the werewolf lying.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"If May is the werewolf, she would naturally deny it.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Yumi,,But Victoria seems so sure! I think I believe her.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I have no reason to lie. Executing May is the safest path for the village.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,May,,"@Jonathan, @Servas, surely you see through this? She's just trying to lead the crowd.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Servas,,I believe Victoria's conviction. I will vote for May.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will follow the lead of the Seer.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"I'm sorry, May! I'm voting for you too.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Victoria,,The evidence is certain.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,May,,You're all making a huge mistake. This isn't over.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
